## Framework: Experimentation — Finding Direction Through Doing

Small experiments beat big plans. **The 4-2-1 Rule:** 4 hours/week on new direction experiments, 2 dedicated learning sessions, 1 check-in per week. Track energy during and after each experiment — not just outcome. Purpose reveals itself through repeated signal, not single data points.

→ Full content: [Experimentation Direction](references/experimentation-purpose.md)

